# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Lockfile is GENERATED OUTPUT, not authored source. Marking it collapses it in GitHub
# diffs/PRs and keeps it out of language stats; `-diff` suppresses the textual diff locally
# too, so `git diff` stays readable when an install re-resolves a few hundred lines.
# Review the package.json change, never the lock. Still COMMITTED — it is what makes
# `npm ci` reproducible. Never hand-edit, with one exception (removing a workspace package:
# surgical JSON parse -> stringify, never a from-scratch regen).
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff

# The platform-layer embed is GENERATED by apps/nebula/scripts/gen-platform.mjs from
# apps/nebula/platform/ + website/docs/nebula/*.md (~200 KiB of docs as one string literal).
# Review the SOURCE files' diff, never the embed's; `--check` in the package `test` script
# reds when they disagree. Committed, like the scaffold seed.
apps/nebula/src/platform-embed.ts linguist-generated=true -diff
